  "title": "KolomKamers [in dev]",
  "languages": ["JS","Python","HTML","CSS"],
  "image": "resources/kkt.png",
  "desc":
  "
  KolomKamers is an online website creator/editor based on a single central column, Inspired by most of my websites.\n\n

  It has a simple dashboard, drag and drop elements, currently working on api support.
  ",
  "popup":
  [
    "KolomKamers",
    "Online web editor",
    {
    "type": "text",
    "data": ["What is Kolomkamers?",
    "<p>
    Kolomkamers is an easy way to create your own website, You can log in, create a website, and share it with others.\n\n

    It could be used for a simple profile / portfolio or for a document or presentation.
    </p>"]
    },
    {
    "type": "image",
    "data": ["resources/kk1.png"]
    },
    {
    "type": "text",
    "data": ["Features in kolomkamers",
    "<p>
    Up until now it has:\n
    - Login / Signup screen\n
    - Working backend server\n
    - Web Editor\n
    - Compact markup language to save space on server\n\n

    I'm planning to add:\n
    - Style editor (markup language already includes style)\n
    - Custom community made tiles\n
    - API support, allowing users to upload tokens that are kept on my server without being public\n\n

    I'm currently creating a document for this project that goes into more depth, which I will share here when done\n
    The github repo is public <a href='https://github.com/FlorisTim/kolomkamer'>right here</a>
    </p>"]
    },
    {
    "type": "text",
    "data": ["Languages used",
